WEBVTT

00:01.760 --> 00:04.030
Previously on "Final Space"...

00:04.070 --> 00:06.400
it's double trouble
aboard the Galaxy One

00:06.440 --> 00:09.000
as the Lord Commander
and the Infinity Guard

00:09.040 --> 00:10.710
are both gunning for our crew.

00:10.740 --> 00:13.180
Little Cato is desperately
trying to contact his father --

00:13.210 --> 00:15.710
Oh, no! --
and Quinn is about to unlock

00:15.740 --> 00:17.580
a huge mystery
threatening Earth.

00:17.610 --> 00:19.180
Oh, double no.

00:19.220 --> 00:21.750
My slacks are tightening
just thinking about this.

00:21.780 --> 00:24.750
Oh, triple no.

00:24.790 --> 00:26.320
[ Alarm beeping ]

00:26.360 --> 00:29.890
H.U.E.: Gary, you have 5 minutes
of oxygen left.

00:29.930 --> 00:31.260
Gary:
I lived a good life.

00:31.290 --> 00:34.000
Medium to good/
borderline crappy.

00:34.030 --> 00:37.200
Saw some side boob once.
That was cool.

00:37.230 --> 00:39.600
H.U.E., have you
ever seen side boob?

00:39.640 --> 00:41.540
Side boob?
No, Gary.

00:41.570 --> 00:43.940
The more you talk,
the more oxygen you --

00:43.970 --> 00:47.340
You're missing out.
I guess it wasn't all that bad.

00:47.380 --> 00:50.950
In fact, I take it back.
I lived a good one.

00:50.980 --> 00:53.280
[ Alarm beeps rapidly ]

00:53.320 --> 00:55.050
Of course! This is --

00:55.080 --> 00:58.090
Thank you! My life sucks!

00:58.120 --> 01:07.100
♪♪

01:07.130 --> 01:16.110
♪♪

01:16.140 --> 01:25.150
♪♪

01:27.080 --> 01:29.050
Gary: This is where
Captain Gary wields

01:29.080 --> 01:32.290
the great giant
scepter of power.

01:32.320 --> 01:35.260
You're not a Captain.
Communication output requested.

01:35.290 --> 01:37.760
Requesting a communications
output, are we?

01:37.790 --> 01:40.460
You really know how
to press my buttons.

01:40.500 --> 01:42.000
Press!
Ugh.

01:42.030 --> 01:45.330
Let me unpress your button
painfully short and clear.

01:45.370 --> 01:48.100
It is never going
to happen between us.

01:48.140 --> 01:49.410
Ever.

01:49.440 --> 01:50.470
[ Thud! ]

01:50.510 --> 01:52.980
That was painfully short...
and clear!

01:53.010 --> 01:54.980
Come on, Quinn.
Why won't you give me a chance?

01:55.010 --> 01:57.310
You impersonated a member
of the Infinity Guard

01:57.350 --> 01:59.820
and blew up
92 Imperium Cruisers.

01:59.850 --> 02:01.850
That doesn't inspire
a lot of trust.

02:01.880 --> 02:03.790
Then I guess this precious
thing we have between us

02:03.820 --> 02:06.160
is not gonna work out.
I'm sorry.

02:06.190 --> 02:09.330
Did you
just break up with me?
Quinn, it's over.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.660
I pulled the Cupid's arrow out,
snapped it,

02:11.690 --> 02:13.460
and threw it into
the break-up flames.

02:13.500 --> 02:16.670
Toast a marshmallow
and get on with your life.

02:16.700 --> 02:18.600
I don't have time for this.
[ Sighs ]

02:18.630 --> 02:21.100
I need to get the password
to the Infinity Guard network.

02:21.140 --> 02:24.470
Does someone need the password
to the Infinity Guard network?

02:24.510 --> 02:26.640
How did you know?
How did I know?

02:26.680 --> 02:28.940
I'm always listening.
Really?

02:28.980 --> 02:30.850
Can you stop that,
like, immediately?

02:30.880 --> 02:31.880
Can I?

02:31.910 --> 02:34.080
No, I can't.

02:35.850 --> 02:37.650
There it is, H.U.E.
Zoom in.

02:37.690 --> 02:39.660
H.U.E.: The breach has
the characteristics

02:39.690 --> 02:41.020
of a black hole,

02:41.060 --> 02:42.360
and it's growing.

02:42.390 --> 02:44.060
You told
the Infinity Guard this

02:44.090 --> 02:46.830
and they didn't listen
and they want to arrest you?

02:46.860 --> 02:48.360
They're total bad guys.

02:48.400 --> 02:50.530
That smell coming from
the Infinity Guard kitchen?

02:50.570 --> 02:53.240
A little dish
I call Corruption Stew!

02:53.270 --> 02:55.370
The Infinity Guard
is not corrupt.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.710
I get it. You're mad
I broke up with you.

02:57.740 --> 02:59.540
My patience
is whittling away.

02:59.580 --> 03:00.880
Whittle away,
temptress.

03:00.910 --> 03:02.650
Your words can't
hurt me anymore.

03:02.680 --> 03:04.550
Wow. How pretty!
What is that?

03:04.580 --> 03:07.680
Plasmic energy
is firing from that planet

03:07.720 --> 03:09.690
directly into the breach.

03:09.720 --> 03:12.820
If the laser continues,
the breach will widen,

03:12.860 --> 03:15.390
and Earth will be consumed.

03:15.420 --> 03:17.890
H.U.E., scan that planet
for inhabitants.

03:17.930 --> 03:20.830
That is
an Infinity Guard Outpost.

03:20.860 --> 03:22.730
It's not a soup.

03:22.770 --> 03:24.270
It's not a broth.

03:24.300 --> 03:27.440
Oh! [ Chuckles ]
I know. It's a stew!

03:27.470 --> 03:30.240
Corruption stew!

03:30.270 --> 03:32.210
There has to be
a good explanation.

03:32.240 --> 03:34.680
We're going. H.U.E.,
prime the lightfold engines.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.550
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

03:36.580 --> 03:40.050
The moment we broke up, that
right went back to el capitan...

03:40.080 --> 03:41.780
H.U.E., how do
we get to the surface?

03:41.820 --> 03:44.090
...with a Captain's
finesse.

03:44.120 --> 03:47.920
[ Screaming ]

03:47.960 --> 03:49.430
Cutting the engines
and gliding in

03:49.460 --> 03:51.930
like a glorious coasting
stealth squirrel

03:51.960 --> 03:53.700
was a bad idea!

03:53.730 --> 04:02.270
♪♪

04:02.310 --> 04:10.610
♪♪

04:10.650 --> 04:11.880
Good news.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.620
If this is the right place,

04:13.650 --> 04:16.550
we're here.

04:16.590 --> 04:17.650
Assessing damage.

04:17.690 --> 04:20.290
The deflector array
is offline.

04:20.320 --> 04:23.130
The power cells
are offline.

04:23.160 --> 04:25.330
The bake shop is offline.

04:25.360 --> 04:27.600
Wait! There's a bake shop
on this thing?!

04:27.630 --> 04:29.330
Quinn: Avocato and I
will scout on foot.

04:29.370 --> 04:31.130
The rest of you stay back
and repair the ship.

04:31.170 --> 04:32.470
Come on, Avocato,
let's go.

04:32.500 --> 04:33.640
What?!

04:33.670 --> 04:36.240
If I could pour
a tall glass of truth-juice

04:36.270 --> 04:38.340
for you real quick,
Quinn --

04:38.370 --> 04:40.110
I am not feeling
the trust.

04:40.140 --> 04:41.980
I only trust three people
in this world --

04:42.010 --> 04:43.410
my dog, my sister,

04:43.450 --> 04:45.250
and every single member
of the Infinity Guard.

04:45.280 --> 04:46.520
You're insane, my lady.

04:46.550 --> 04:48.980
The Infinity Guard
tried to kidnap you.

04:49.020 --> 04:50.950
And they tried to take
over the Galaxy One.

04:50.990 --> 04:52.490
And dogs
aren't even people.

04:52.520 --> 04:54.490
I have no reason
to trust any of you,

04:54.520 --> 04:57.190
so I'm going with the guy
literally covered in guns.

04:59.700 --> 05:01.130
KVN, fix the ship.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.700
Also, don't touch
any of my stuff.

05:02.730 --> 05:05.670
Or Quinn's stuff. Or Avocato's.
Or the cookies. Ju--

05:05.700 --> 05:08.370
Jus-- Just don't touch anything.
Specifically buttons.

05:08.400 --> 05:10.610
And especially
flamethrowers.

05:10.640 --> 05:12.980
But do fix the ship,
and then die.

05:13.010 --> 05:15.680
Okay? [ Chuckles ] Okay.
Okay, come on, Mooncake!

05:15.710 --> 05:19.520
Wow!
[ Laughs ]

05:19.550 --> 05:20.680
Ugh.

05:23.090 --> 05:28.520
[ Laughs maniacally ]

05:28.560 --> 05:30.860
[ Giggles ] Hooray!

05:30.890 --> 05:32.130
[ Clanging ]

05:32.160 --> 05:34.460
[ Chuckles ]

05:34.500 --> 05:35.500
Watch this.

05:35.530 --> 05:36.870
[ Smooching ]

05:36.900 --> 05:39.030
Stop!
Stop staring.

05:39.070 --> 05:41.740
Flamethrowers! Hooray!

05:41.770 --> 05:42.810
I'm burning things!

05:42.840 --> 05:44.710
[ Giggles ]

05:44.740 --> 05:46.910
S.A.M.E.S.:
Wait, what? Aah.

05:46.940 --> 05:50.550
[ Rumbling in distance ]

05:50.580 --> 05:52.420
Little Cato: Dad,
these are my coordinates.

05:52.450 --> 05:54.180
Come find me.
[ Beep ]

05:54.220 --> 05:57.850
Stupid thing won't work!
[ Grunts ]

05:57.890 --> 06:00.390
Be brave.
Huh?

06:00.420 --> 06:03.260
We're going to
get you out of here.

06:05.760 --> 06:10.070
Why should I trust you?
We share the same enemy.

06:10.100 --> 06:11.830
I gotta send a message
to my father.

06:11.870 --> 06:13.400
Can you amplify
my signal?

06:13.440 --> 06:16.710
There's a transmitting station.
I can show you the way.

06:16.740 --> 06:17.940
Now run!

06:17.970 --> 06:21.240
♪♪

06:23.680 --> 06:25.410
Chocli.

06:25.450 --> 06:27.280
[ Laughs ]

06:29.620 --> 06:31.420
Ooh!

06:31.450 --> 06:36.860
♪♪

06:36.890 --> 06:42.230
♪♪

06:42.260 --> 06:44.100
Hey, man-- Oh!
Oh, my gosh!

06:44.130 --> 06:46.600
You just don't cleave everybody
in the neck meat, Avocato!

06:46.640 --> 06:48.540
What the freak?!

06:48.570 --> 06:50.540
Let me give you
some advice, buddy.

06:50.570 --> 06:53.110
Yes.
If you want Quinn
to trust you,

06:53.140 --> 06:55.210
you gotta step up
and show her you can lead.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.910
Make direct eye contact,

06:56.950 --> 07:00.480
then don't let go until you kiss
her soul with your eyelashes.

07:00.520 --> 07:02.120
Like this.

07:02.150 --> 07:04.790
Too much, or just enough?

07:04.820 --> 07:08.090
Oh, my wow. Oh, my wow!
It's glorious!

07:08.120 --> 07:10.730
Yeah. So you got it?
I got it. It's done.

07:10.760 --> 07:11.760
Done and done.

07:11.790 --> 07:14.300
Hi, Quinn.

07:14.330 --> 07:17.430
Too little,
or just enough?

07:17.470 --> 07:18.670
Ahhhh!

07:18.700 --> 07:19.970
Just go back to the ship.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.400
You're not
a trained soldier.

07:21.440 --> 07:24.170
You're a...nobody.
[ Chuckles ] Okay.

07:24.210 --> 07:25.910
I didn't expect
that hurt coin deposit

07:25.940 --> 07:28.140
in my sadness savings.
Good Lord.

07:28.180 --> 07:30.610
Look, Gary, I'm not
trying to be mean.

07:30.650 --> 07:32.480
If you get hurt or die --

07:32.520 --> 07:35.350
Well, that's a responsibility
I don't want.

07:35.380 --> 07:37.950
That's just the truth.
I don't accept your truth.

07:37.990 --> 07:39.150
And that was
incredibly mean.

07:39.190 --> 07:40.760
I'm sorry.
I don't think you are.

07:40.790 --> 07:42.930
You're right.
I'm not.

07:42.960 --> 07:44.660
You have a bite to you.
I like that.

07:44.690 --> 07:47.030
I promise, you will
end up trusting me.

07:47.060 --> 07:49.500
And revel in
my awesomeness as I...

07:49.530 --> 07:52.500
karate chop this magnificent --
[ Vocalizing ] --

07:52.540 --> 07:54.000
disturbingly agile...

07:54.040 --> 07:55.970
freaking bug angel!

07:57.970 --> 07:59.470
I think that thing
just bit me.

07:59.510 --> 08:01.510
[ High-pitched voice ] Ahhhhhh!
-Holy crap!

08:01.540 --> 08:04.050
It's a beautiful nightmare
shrinking demon!

08:07.920 --> 08:09.720
[ Roars ]
Aah!

08:09.750 --> 08:11.790
Hoorah!

08:11.820 --> 08:13.360
Stay with me, Avocato!
Aah!

08:13.390 --> 08:15.620
I won't rest until
a cure is found.

08:15.660 --> 08:18.130
[ Grunts ]

08:18.160 --> 08:20.030
Mooncake,
give Avocato a ride.

08:20.060 --> 08:21.330
Aah!

08:21.360 --> 08:23.200
Mooncake: Mmmmm-hmmmm!

08:23.230 --> 08:26.700
Whoa!

08:26.740 --> 08:28.300
I got your back, Mooncake!

08:28.340 --> 08:30.670
Yee-haw!

08:30.710 --> 08:32.240
[ Pew! Pew! Pew! ]

08:32.270 --> 08:33.710
[ Laughs ] What was that?!
I mean, wha-- like a little--

08:33.740 --> 08:35.980
a little silly string
shooting out of your gun?

08:36.010 --> 08:38.380
Like...
[ Laughs ] I mean, that's --

08:38.410 --> 08:39.750
that's like --
What were you even

08:39.780 --> 08:41.050
trying to accomplish
right there?

08:41.080 --> 08:43.690
I mean --
Okay, foll-follow me!

08:43.720 --> 08:45.520
[ Grunts ]

08:45.550 --> 08:53.330
♪♪

08:53.360 --> 08:55.100
Spider!
Spider!

08:55.130 --> 08:58.230
It's a spider!

08:58.270 --> 08:59.770
Ohhh, it's a spider!

09:01.770 --> 09:04.410
Aah! Oh! [ Grunts ]

09:04.440 --> 09:05.440
Aah!

09:05.470 --> 09:08.880
That's weird.
It says we're...here?

09:08.910 --> 09:10.750
Dear Heavenly
Lightning Lord!

09:10.780 --> 09:12.110
Are you not seeing this?!

09:12.150 --> 09:14.850
Seeing what?

09:14.880 --> 09:15.780
Ugh.

09:15.820 --> 09:16.850
It's right here.

09:16.890 --> 09:20.090
Seeing...this.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.590
What the hell
is that thing?

09:21.620 --> 09:26.290
♪♪

09:26.330 --> 09:27.730
Are you talking about
the giant laser?

09:27.760 --> 09:29.360
Because if you're talking
about the giant laser,

09:29.400 --> 09:30.770
it's a giant laser.

09:30.800 --> 09:32.400
I know it's a giant laser.

09:32.430 --> 09:35.940
Giant doesn't even begin
to describe what I'm seeing.

09:35.970 --> 09:41.540
[ Alarm blaring in distance ]

09:41.580 --> 09:42.780
[ Whirring ]

09:42.810 --> 09:45.450
Computer:
Laser activation commencing.

09:45.480 --> 09:50.790
♪♪

09:50.820 --> 09:55.820
♪♪

09:55.860 --> 09:58.760
That's what's been creating
the gravitational disturbance.

09:58.790 --> 10:00.460
I thought the Earth
was being sucked

10:00.500 --> 10:02.770
into a black hole,
but I was wrong.

10:02.800 --> 10:05.070
This whole thing is
being orchestrated --

10:05.100 --> 10:06.800
By who?
Or is it whom?

10:06.840 --> 10:10.810
Either way, it's probably
by some serious bad guy.

10:13.340 --> 10:15.010
What a twist!

10:15.040 --> 10:16.310
Infinity Guard Army:
For the galaxy!

10:16.340 --> 10:19.350
For eternity!
For Lord Commander!

10:19.380 --> 10:23.950
With each blast, we get
closer to Final Space!

10:23.990 --> 10:25.650
So, keep it up.

10:25.690 --> 10:29.790
Good job, Jeff.
Hearing great things.

10:29.830 --> 10:31.460
Yes!

10:31.490 --> 10:33.330
How the hell
do I turn this off?

10:33.360 --> 10:35.960
Eric!
How do I turn this off?

10:36.000 --> 10:39.270
Is it the red knob?
Do I turn it left?

10:39.300 --> 10:42.040
Eric, stop crying!

10:42.070 --> 10:44.270
I'm just going to walk away.

10:44.310 --> 10:45.770
The Lord Commander.

10:45.810 --> 10:48.110
He's taken over
the Infinity Guard.

10:48.140 --> 10:49.510
They're destroying
Earth.

10:49.540 --> 10:52.050
They're --
Corrupt! Told ya!

10:52.080 --> 10:53.520
Now do you trust me?

10:53.550 --> 10:57.050
No. Now I'm the only person
I can trust.

10:57.090 --> 11:00.160
And Gary. You left out Gary.
And Hot Wheels Avocato.

11:00.190 --> 11:03.190
What I lack in size
I make up for in wisdom.

11:03.230 --> 11:04.530
So now that you're tiny

11:04.560 --> 11:06.290
you're like the new Socrates
or something?

11:06.330 --> 11:09.630
Whatever. C'mon, squad.
She needs backup!

11:09.660 --> 11:10.470
[ Grunts ]

11:10.500 --> 11:11.870
Oh, well, I guess not.

11:11.900 --> 11:15.000
I guess I could just sit here
and pop my lips.

11:15.040 --> 11:16.470
[ Pop! Pop! ]

11:16.500 --> 11:16.770
[ Pop! ]

11:20.940 --> 11:22.240
♪ Burning love

11:22.280 --> 11:24.910
♪ Burning love,
hot burning love ♪

11:24.950 --> 11:27.920
♪ Love, love,
love burning love ♪

11:27.950 --> 11:29.520
Beth, I want you to know

11:29.550 --> 11:31.890
that this has been the happiest
moment of KVN's life.

11:31.920 --> 11:33.520
I can see it
on your face.

11:33.560 --> 11:34.420
We are so happy.

11:34.460 --> 11:36.390
-She is so hot.
-Stop!

11:36.420 --> 11:38.530
Stop staring.
So creepy.

11:38.560 --> 11:40.260
Now do my bidding!
Fix the ship.

11:40.300 --> 11:43.200
I will kill KVN
and take Beth for my own.

11:43.230 --> 11:44.900
Over my cold,
dead hands.

11:44.930 --> 11:47.200
Death fight.
We've got a death fight.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.900
Now, where were we?

11:48.940 --> 11:50.940
[ Lasers blasting ]

11:50.970 --> 11:54.780
♪♪

11:54.810 --> 11:56.440
How the hell
does Jeff do it?

11:56.480 --> 11:57.610
[ Sighs ]

11:57.650 --> 12:01.680
♪♪

12:01.720 --> 12:03.420
[ Grunting ]

12:03.450 --> 12:04.450
Aah!

12:04.490 --> 12:07.220
Ugh.

12:07.260 --> 12:09.460
I told you,
I'm doing this on my own.

12:09.490 --> 12:11.790
The hell you are.
Like it or not, we're a team.

12:11.830 --> 12:15.200
And you can't spell "team"
without "M" and "E",

12:15.230 --> 12:16.870
and you know
what that spells...

12:16.900 --> 12:17.900
"Us."

12:17.930 --> 12:19.270
Fine.
Fine.

12:19.300 --> 12:22.070
A job worth doing is
worth doing together.

12:22.100 --> 12:23.310
Thank you, Avocato.

12:23.340 --> 12:25.270
But a vision
becomes a nightmare

12:25.310 --> 12:28.280
when the leader has
a big dream and a bad team!

12:28.310 --> 12:30.310
Okay, okay! Shut up
with that stuff.

12:30.350 --> 12:32.380
I don't even know what
you're talking about.

12:32.410 --> 12:34.720
Computer: Laser activation
in four minutes.

12:34.750 --> 12:37.950
Geez. Oh, my gosh.

12:37.990 --> 12:41.590
Superior Stone,
that bastard.

12:43.530 --> 12:45.090
Come on, we're
running out of time.

12:45.130 --> 12:46.560
We gotta go around.

12:46.590 --> 12:49.600
♪♪

12:49.630 --> 12:52.470
Ohhhh, crap.

12:55.270 --> 12:58.640
Aah! Laser hell --
[ Whispering ] Shhh!
The walls are thin.

12:58.670 --> 13:00.810
Do not make a sound,
or they'll hear us!

13:00.840 --> 13:02.580
[ Whispering ]
You expect us -- Ow! --

13:02.610 --> 13:04.450
to climb through
this electric pain-maze

13:04.480 --> 13:05.750
without making a sound?

13:05.780 --> 13:06.820
We're not wizards.

13:06.850 --> 13:07.920
Ow!

13:07.950 --> 13:10.350
Will everyone
please shut up!

13:10.390 --> 13:11.490
Aah!

13:11.520 --> 13:12.820
Okay!
We'll do it your --

13:12.860 --> 13:13.960
Ohhhhh!

13:13.990 --> 13:16.460
Aa-ga-gaah!
Aa-ga-gaah!

13:16.490 --> 13:18.790
Right on
the downstairs mustache.

13:18.830 --> 13:21.000
Do you not see
this is the worst possible

13:21.030 --> 13:22.830
ti-i-i-ime
for this?!

13:22.870 --> 13:23.970
Tuff titty whompas!

13:24.000 --> 13:25.700
Company hold.
Titty whompas!

13:25.730 --> 13:28.670
Did you hear that?
Sounded like
"tuff titty whompas."

13:28.700 --> 13:31.710
What the hell is
a tuff titty whompas?

13:31.740 --> 13:35.210
It's probably a rat.
Do rats say
"tuff titty whompas"?

13:35.240 --> 13:36.880
The big ones do.

13:39.980 --> 13:42.180
Oh!

13:42.220 --> 13:43.990
[ Laughs ]

13:44.020 --> 13:45.390
Oh, my God! Aah!

13:45.420 --> 13:48.220
You're like a tiny
little Avocato bobble head!

13:48.260 --> 13:49.690
[ Laughs ]

13:49.720 --> 13:50.960
Aah!

13:50.990 --> 13:55.960
♪♪

13:56.000 --> 13:58.130
Alert! Escapee.
Lock it down!
[ Alarm blares ]

13:58.170 --> 14:00.170
[ Guard screams ]

14:02.070 --> 14:03.840
Now run!
Ya think?

14:03.870 --> 14:07.480
♪♪

14:07.510 --> 14:10.780
Computer: Laser activation
in 90 seconds.

14:12.950 --> 14:14.420
[ Guns cock ]

14:14.450 --> 14:16.180
Have you all
lost your minds?!

14:16.220 --> 14:18.090
You're working for
the Lord Commander!

14:18.120 --> 14:19.420
We're Infinity Guard --

14:19.450 --> 14:21.590
the last vestige of hope
in the universe.

14:21.620 --> 14:24.760
What you're doing here
is going to destroy the Earth,

14:24.790 --> 14:26.590
our home.

14:26.630 --> 14:29.600
Stop this.
I'm begging you.

14:29.630 --> 14:32.100
Stop.

14:32.130 --> 14:34.770
That's a good speech,
but, nah.

14:34.800 --> 14:35.570
Nah, ain't happening.

14:35.600 --> 14:39.570
[ Guards chatter, laugh ]

14:42.140 --> 14:44.250
Yeah, no,
we're not stopping.

14:45.410 --> 14:47.220
You know what to do,
Avocato. Hoorah!

14:47.250 --> 14:54.090
♪♪

14:54.120 --> 14:58.030
I'm back, baby!
Whoo! Yeah!

14:58.060 --> 15:00.530
I'm electrified, baby!

15:00.560 --> 15:04.130
Whoo! Murder Beam activate!
Yeah! Oh, yeah!

15:04.170 --> 15:07.970
I go high, you go low!
Yes!

15:10.840 --> 15:13.210
Yeah! Gary, how're them
guns back there?

15:13.240 --> 15:15.840
They're hot, baby!

15:17.980 --> 15:19.150
Yes!

15:19.180 --> 15:23.520
♪♪

15:27.490 --> 15:30.060
Stone! You traitor!

15:30.090 --> 15:34.600
What I do, I do
for the Infinity Guard!

15:34.630 --> 15:37.170
You double-crossing
sphincter sack.

15:37.200 --> 15:40.470
Quinn,
you can still join us.

15:40.500 --> 15:42.070
You're just about
the only one

15:42.100 --> 15:47.340
who hasn't pledged allegiance
to the Lord Commander.

15:47.380 --> 15:50.350
Don't do it, Quinn!
Don't do it!

15:50.380 --> 15:52.850
We have such a good thing
going here!

15:52.880 --> 15:55.320
I'm not joining him,
you freaking weirdo.

15:55.350 --> 15:59.150
Don't join forces
with this guy!

15:59.190 --> 16:01.090
Don't do it!

16:01.120 --> 16:02.660
Why are you doing this?

16:02.690 --> 16:05.790
The Lord Commander has seen
what's on the other side.

16:05.830 --> 16:08.760
Once we break into
Final Space,

16:08.800 --> 16:11.970
we'll flood the world
with light,

16:12.000 --> 16:15.370
and there will be
no more death.

16:15.400 --> 16:17.540
That's because there
will be no more life.

16:17.570 --> 16:20.380
At first.
But not at second.

16:20.410 --> 16:23.210
And don't even get me
started on thirdly.

16:23.250 --> 16:26.680
Anyway, Quinn,
we should thank you.

16:26.710 --> 16:27.850
What?

16:27.880 --> 16:29.620
Your scribbling
on a bar napkin allowed us

16:29.650 --> 16:31.890
to finally break through
the quantum barriers

16:31.920 --> 16:34.390
and tear through
this universe.

16:34.420 --> 16:37.890
So you see,
this is all your work.

16:43.570 --> 16:44.870
Cheer up.

16:44.900 --> 16:48.540
You won't have to live
with the guilt much longer...

16:50.710 --> 16:52.570
...because now
there's no stopping us

16:52.610 --> 16:56.810
from tearing a hole
into Final Space.

16:56.840 --> 16:59.850
Computer: Commencing laser fire
in 30 seconds.

16:59.880 --> 17:03.190
Hey, sphincter sack!
Rock, paper, scissors.

17:03.220 --> 17:05.190
I'm not
playing this game.

17:05.220 --> 17:07.220
Close! Paper!

17:10.690 --> 17:12.890
Aah!

17:12.930 --> 17:16.600
[ Chuckles ] Guy just got sucked
into a big ol' butthole.

17:16.630 --> 17:18.500
Gary, we got
a laser to take out.

17:18.530 --> 17:20.030
Okay!
Okay, let's go!

17:20.070 --> 17:22.040
It's all my fault.

17:22.070 --> 17:23.570
Quinn,
it's not your fault.

17:23.610 --> 17:26.540
I can't even trust
myself anymore.

17:26.570 --> 17:29.210
Okay, you're digging deep,
and there's some real powerful

17:29.240 --> 17:30.750
self-discovery stuff
going on here,

17:30.780 --> 17:33.420
but there's a giant laser
about to fire,

17:33.450 --> 17:35.520
so if we could just
stick a pin in this

17:35.550 --> 17:37.390
and pick it up
over snacks soon-ish?

17:37.420 --> 17:40.460
Laser activation
in 10 seconds.

17:40.490 --> 17:43.530
Stone shot out the controls.
The laser can't be stopped.

17:43.560 --> 17:45.460
Laser activation
commencing now.

17:45.490 --> 17:46.690
Mooncake,
shoot the laser!

17:46.730 --> 17:48.400
Are you crazy?
Yes! Shoot the laser!

17:48.430 --> 17:49.530
-Chocli.
-Shoot the laser!

17:49.560 --> 17:50.570
-Chocli?
-Shoot the laser!

17:50.600 --> 17:51.900
-Chocli!
-Shoot it! Shoot it!

17:51.930 --> 17:53.900
-Shoot the laser!
-Chocli!

17:53.940 --> 18:03.280
♪♪

18:03.310 --> 18:06.650
Ooh...
-Oh. My. Crap.

18:10.320 --> 18:12.250
The elevator! Hurry!

18:14.260 --> 18:17.460
[ All screaming ]

18:17.490 --> 18:18.790
Tuff titty whompas!

18:18.830 --> 18:21.630
KVN? H.U.E.? We need
an emergency extraction!

18:25.200 --> 18:27.770
Whoa!
Mooncake!

18:27.800 --> 18:32.970
♪♪

18:33.010 --> 18:38.280
♪♪

18:38.310 --> 18:39.510
Aah!

18:39.550 --> 18:40.950
[ Gasps ]

18:43.890 --> 18:45.950
We're going to die!

18:45.990 --> 18:47.620
Not if you trust me.

18:47.660 --> 18:49.120
I'm sorry.

18:49.160 --> 18:50.690
I can't.

18:50.730 --> 18:53.760
I think you can.

18:53.800 --> 18:54.630
Okay.

18:54.660 --> 18:56.960
Okay.
And don't worry.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.370
I have one of these.

18:59.830 --> 19:03.610
Aaah!

19:03.640 --> 19:06.870
Aah! Why would they
connect the nerve endings

19:06.910 --> 19:09.540
to my robot hand?!

19:09.580 --> 19:10.810
Aah!

19:10.850 --> 19:12.010
Whyyyy?!

19:12.050 --> 19:14.050
Aah!

19:14.080 --> 19:17.020
Whoa!

19:17.050 --> 19:18.220
Aah!

19:18.250 --> 19:20.560
Aah! Whoa!

19:20.590 --> 19:21.890
Gary:
When I woke up this morning,

19:21.920 --> 19:23.830
I did not think,
"I'm going to die."

19:23.860 --> 19:26.960
But look at us.
Look at me, look at her.

19:26.990 --> 19:30.630
Here we are. A unit.
Dying together.

19:30.670 --> 19:33.340
Oh, no, wait!
Look, the Galaxy One! Yeah!

19:33.370 --> 19:34.870
Gary: Aah!

19:34.900 --> 19:36.070
♪♪

19:36.100 --> 19:37.340
Oh!

19:37.370 --> 19:44.210
♪♪

19:44.250 --> 19:45.550
You came through.

19:45.580 --> 19:48.620
Woman: I told you --
we fight the same war.

19:50.220 --> 19:52.850
[ Beeping ]
But it's key locked.

19:52.890 --> 19:56.390
43728.

19:56.420 --> 19:57.530
[ Computer chimes ]
[ Chuckles ]

19:57.560 --> 20:00.260
I'm in.
Thanks. I owe you.

20:00.300 --> 20:02.730
Dad, these are my coordinates.
Come find me.

20:02.760 --> 20:04.100
I mean, at your leisure,

20:04.130 --> 20:05.530
but like, for me,
preferably fast.

20:05.570 --> 20:06.730
That'd be great.

20:06.770 --> 20:08.200
And...send!

20:08.240 --> 20:11.240
You did it! You did!

20:11.270 --> 20:14.380
[ Voice deepens ]
You -- You did it!

20:14.410 --> 20:19.510
You sent your father
and Mooncake right to me.

20:19.550 --> 20:21.720
No, no, no, no, nooooo!

20:21.750 --> 20:28.060
♪♪

20:28.090 --> 20:34.460
♪♪

20:34.500 --> 20:37.300
What, uh...
what are you doing?

20:37.330 --> 20:38.630
Starting over.

20:38.670 --> 20:40.300
You were right
about everything.

20:40.340 --> 20:42.440
I know.
It's a blessing.

20:42.470 --> 20:44.540
And my curse.

20:44.570 --> 20:46.570
If the Lord Commander
corrupted the Infinity Guard

20:46.610 --> 20:49.580
it means there's
no good guys left.

20:49.610 --> 20:51.110
Yes, there are.

20:51.150 --> 20:52.250
Who?

20:52.280 --> 20:53.420
-Us.
-Chocli.

20:53.450 --> 20:55.620
Healthy people trust.

20:55.650 --> 20:58.090
We need more of that,
not less.

20:58.120 --> 20:59.620
But how can I?

20:59.650 --> 21:02.120
You begin right here...

21:04.430 --> 21:06.430
...with this guy.

21:06.460 --> 21:09.960
We're the good guys now.

21:10.000 --> 21:11.930
Okay, then.

21:11.970 --> 21:13.170
Us.

21:13.200 --> 21:14.340
Yeah.

21:14.370 --> 21:16.000
Us.

21:16.040 --> 21:18.910
[ Chuckles ] Oh, KVN!

21:18.940 --> 21:23.780
What in the three rings of hell
did you do to the ship?!
